  "_README": "Starter canvas for 4d-blog-engine hero scenes. The hero-scene-composer skill copies this JSON, swaps the {{PLACEHOLDER}} strings using the scene-outline.json values, and drops icon JSON snippets from references/excalidraw-icon-vocab.md into the named slots (left_panel_icon_anchor, right_panel_icon_anchor, chart_anchor). Coordinates are absolute pixels on a 1600x900 canvas. Brand colors are filled by the composer from the project's blog-project-instructions.md '## Hero image brand style' block. Default values shown here are the warm-editorial palette.",
